  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PRDA: Community-based Peacebuilding in Upper Nile State</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The community-based peacebuilding project in Upper Nile State aims to strengthen local conflict resolution mechanisms by engaging community leaders, peace committees, and diverse groups in dialogue and reconciliation efforts. The project supports trust-building activities, promotes social cohesion, integrates peace messaging into existing community structures, ensuring sustainable peace at the grassroots level.</narrative>
  </description>
